{"name":"Tanglewood","hex":"#a58f85","fetched":"2026-10-13","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"Tanglewood","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Proper noun","definitions":["A locality in the Tweed council area, north eastern New South Wales, Australia."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Tanglewood"}],"entries":[{"title":"Tanglewood","blocks":[{"text":"Tanglewood is a music venue and festival in the towns of Lenox and Stockbridge in the Berkshire Hills of western Massachusetts. It has been the summer home of the Boston Symphony Orchestra since 1937. Tanglewood is also home to three music schools: the Tanglewood Music Center, Tanglewood Learning Center, and the Boston University Tanglewood Institute. Besides classical music, Tanglewood hosts the Festival of Contemporary Music, jazz and popular artists, concerts, and frequent appearances by James Taylor, John Williams, and the Boston Pops."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tanglewood"},{"title":"Tanglewood (2018 video game)","blocks":[{"text":"Tanglewood is a 2018 puzzle platform video game developed and published by Big Evil Corporation for the Sega Genesis/Mega Drive. It was crowdfunded through Kickstarter and released on 14 August 2018, with emulated versions available for Windows, Mac, and Linux on Steam and a dual-game cartridge for the Evercade along with Xeno Crisis."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/4/4f/Tanglewood_cover_art.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tanglewood_(2018_video_game)"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/db/Tanglewood_Front_Gate.jpg/500px-Tanglewood_Front_Gate.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/db/Tanglewood_Front_Gate.jpg/1280px-Tanglewood_Front_Gate.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thu